<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>love is embarrassing</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Olivia Rodrigo</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">GUTS (spilled)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3jhlwdu8nU7hFTEGHUomN3</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.440" end="00:10.340">I told my friends you were the one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.340" end="00:13.310">After I'd known you, like, a month</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.310" end="00:19.050">And then you kissed some girl from high school</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.050" end="00:22.380">And I stayed in bed for, like, a week</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.380" end="00:25.130">When you said space was what you need</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.130" end="00:30.360">Waited by my phone just like a damn fool</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.360" end="00:33.450">And now it don't mean a thing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.450" end="00:36.490">God, love's just so embarrassin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.490" end="00:42.420">Just watch as I crucify myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.420" end="00:45.560">For some weird second string</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.560" end="00:48.470">Loser who's not worth mentionin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.470" end="00:55.350">My God, love's embarrassin' as hell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.350" end="00:58.360">And I consoled you while you cried</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.360" end="01:01.300">Over your ex-girlfriend's new guy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.300" end="01:07.280">My God, how could I be so stupid?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.280" end="01:10.230">You found a new version of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.230" end="01:13.310">And I damn near started World War III</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.310" end="01:18.370">Jesus, what was I even doin'?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.370" end="01:21.450">'Cause now it don't mean a thing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.450" end="01:24.520">God, love's just so embarrassin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.520" end="01:30.400">Just watch as I crucify myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.400" end="01:33.350">For some weird second string</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.350" end="01:36.410">Loser who's not worth mentionin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.410" end="01:42.470">My God, love's embarrassin' as hell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.470" end="01:45.710">I give up, give up, I give up everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.710" end="01:48.860">I placed my bets and it's not worth anything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.860" end="01:54.880">I give up, give up, but I keep comin' back for more, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.880" end="01:57.490">It don't mean a thing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.490" end="02:00.470">God, love's just so embarrassin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.470" end="02:06.700">Just watch as I crucify myself, hey, hey, hey</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.700" end="02:09.440">For some weird second string</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.440" end="02:12.310">Loser who's not worth mentionin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.310" end="02:17.610">My God, love's embarrassin' as hell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.610" end="02:21.880">Yeah, yeah, I give up, give up, I give up everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.880" end="02:24.700">I'm plannin' out my weddin' with some guy I'm never marryin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.700" end="02:30.050">I'm givin' up, I'm givin' up, but I keep comin' back for more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.050" end="02:34.050" /></div></body></tt>